  "question": "Five moles of hydrogen initially at STP are compressed adiabatically so that its temperature becomes $673$ K. The increase in internal energy of the gas, in kilojoule, is ($R = 8.3$ J/mol K; $\\gamma = 1.4$ for diatomic gas)",
